ARTEFACTS: report coord/reports/S1896-boundary-cusp-actual.md; AUDIT_LEDGER.md entry appended (S1896, 2026-11-01). I did NOT touch coord/dag, coord/STATE.md or coord/queue.md (left to you to avoid concurrent-edit conflicts) - the report contains the delivery table and the one executable next step.`;
